---
title: A page no collection matched
---
<a href="<lem.page.url>"><lem.site.tagline></a>

A template with front matter is a page, and one no glob matched and no `type:` named has
no schema: `page` is unknown-typed and the file renders — a field nothing declares is the
VM's to find (D30). The front matter loads nothing, so `page.title` here would be the
envelope's value, not the one above.
